orical_business_count":5},{"category":"Champagne Bars","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"WYSqcpQv0OA8RyE7f2mnnw","review_id":"iRJC3p5U-i_OckRZuRPVkw","date":"2017-12-26T17:29:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9402364492416382,"text_excerpt":"This was one of my favorite places in New Orleans. Even though the place was busy, we snagged a table by the window, away from the crowded sofa areas. The menu has an extensive selection of champagnes, which means there is something for even the pickiest of drinkers! We ended up trying the the catena \"alma negra\" malbec rosé, the ca' furlan \"cuvée adriana\" moscato, the bianca vigna prosecco, and the honey island daiquiri--all delicious. The free popcorn and the side of pommes frites we ordered also tasted pretty good. The service was excellent, the prices were decent, and it was great experience all around."},{"business_id":"WYSqcpQv0OA8RyE7f2mnnw","review_id":"4E_050PlpIZh9HfW6jyfGg","date":"2018-06-27T15:24:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9392886757850647,"text_excerpt":"This place is gorgeous! The owner and staff were very friendly. I was a little worried we were underdressed in shorts and tank tops but they didn't care. My friends shared a champagne flight and I had the champagne of beers. The food was really good to. We got there pretty late in the evening but there late night menu still filled us up."},{"business_id":"WYSqcpQv0OA8RyE7f2mnnw","review_id":"LpPgOMmqAg-ImiOl-bFXnw","date":"2021-10-13T03:29:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.929354727268219,"text_excerpt":"Lovvvvvveree Effervescence!! It's such a cute spot to go get drinks with your girls or do a date night nightcap. You have dining on the inside or the outside. They also host movie nights where they put the screen on outside. I still can't believe that I tried caviar for the first time! Our waiter did an awesome job at describing each option for caviar. This one in particular was the less fishy of the three. I've recently got really into red wines specifically Cabernet Sauvignon! It's a huge glass with a really nice pour! Overall, it's a really great place! If you have not been, I suggest that you go. Reservations are highly recommended!!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"WYSqcpQv0OA8RyE7f2mnnw","photo_id":"svY4xkHn9sOKjUvS8oi4UA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/svY4xkHn9sOKjUvS8oi4UA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.888788104057312},{"business_id":"WYSqcpQv0OA8RyE7f2mnnw","photo_id":"OO-0iOE_r8oD-UDoSTuzIw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/OO-0iOE_r8oD-UDoSTuzIw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8780236840248108},{"business_id":"WYSqcpQv0OA8RyE7